/***********************************************************************
 *
 *	Copyright (c) Geoworks 1994 -- All Rights Reserved
 *
 * PROJECT:	  PC/GEOS
 * MODULE:	  CommonUI/CMain (common code for several specific UIs)
 * FILE:	  cmainUIDocOperations.goc
 *
 * DESCRIPTION:
 *	The dialogs of OLDocumentControlClass, the C port of
 *	cmainUIDocOperations.asm: the main dialog (new, open ...), open,
 *	use template, save as, copy to, move to, the document's type
 *	and password.
 *
 *	A dialog ("summons") is a copy of its resource of
 *	cmainUIDocumentControl.ui, made when it comes up and destroyed
 *	when it goes; its block's output is the control, which so gets
 *	the messages of its triggers, file selector and texts.  The
 *	application's group for the dialog (GDCI_openGroup ...) is put
 *	into the copy while it is up.
 *
 * Port32 (Port32/ABI.md section 13y):
 *	- the summons of each resource has a chunk of its own (the asm
 *	  relied on it being the first of each): OLDCI_summonsChunk has
 *	  it beside OLDCI_currentSummons;
 *	- _DUI, CUSTOM_DOCUMENT_PATH, SINGLE_DRIVE_DOCUMENT_DIR, the
 *	  design assistant and NO_USER_LEVELS are not Motif's and are
 *	  left out;
 *	- the note before a read-only document is saved under another
 *	  name comes with OLDocumentClass, which has its strings.
 *
 ***********************************************************************/

